# Kitzbühel Ski Tracking App - Implementation Plan

A Progressive Web App (PWA) for real-time ski tracking at the Kitzbühel ski area, optimized for iOS mobile usage with instant deployment and no App Store approval required.

## Why PWA Instead of Native iOS?

For your specific requirements (**immediate iOS testing without waiting for any approval**), a PWA is the optimal choice:

| Approach | Approval Required | Cost | iOS Access | Time to Deploy |
|----------|------------------|------|------------|----------------|
| **PWA** ✅ | **None** | **$0** | GPS, Offline, Install to Home | **Immediate** |
| TestFlight | Apple Review (24-48h) | $99/year | Full Native | 2-3 days |
| Expo Go | None | $0 | Limited (no background) | 1 day |
| Ad Hoc | Apple Developer Account | $99/year | Full Native | 1 day |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> A PWA can access GPS with **speed tracking (m/s)**, **heading/direction**, and **altitude** - everything needed for ski tracking. The app will work offline and feel native when installed to your iPhone home screen.

---

## Proposed Features

### Core Tracking (MVP)
- 🎿 **Real-time Speed** - Current speed in km/h with live updates
- 🏔️ **Max Speed** - Track your highest speed of the run/day
- 📏 **Distance Traveled** - Total km skied
- ⬇️ **Altitude** - Current elevation + vertical meters descended
- ⏱️ **Run Timer** - Active skiing time

### Advanced Features
- 🗺️ **Interactive Ski Map** - Kitzbühel trails with live position overlay
- 📊 **Run History** - Save each run with stats (persists in browser)
- 🏆 **Records Dashboard** - Personal bests for speed, distance, vertical
- ❄️ **Slope Detection** - Identify which piste you're on
- 📱 **Offline Mode** - Works without internet on the mountain
- 🌙 **Dark Mode** - Easy on eyes, saves battery

### Future Enhancements (Phase 2)
- 🎫 **Lift Wait Times** - Integration with ski area APIs
- 👥 **Social Features** - Share runs with friends
- 📈 **Season Statistics** - Total runs, km, vertical over time
- 🗣️ **Voice Announcements** - Speed callouts while skiing

---

## Technical Architecture

### Technology Stack
- **HTML5 + CSS3 + Vanilla JavaScript** - No framework overhead, fast loading
- **Mapbox GL JS** - Beautiful vector maps with ski trail overlays
- **Service Workers** - Offline caching for mountain use
- **IndexedDB** - Persistent storage for run history (up to 500MB)
- **Web Geolocation API** - GPS tracking with speed/heading

### Project Structure

```
SKI_APP/
├── index.html              # Main app shell
├── manifest.json           # PWA manifest for iOS install
├── sw.js                   # Service worker for offline
├── css/
│   └── styles.css          # Premium dark-mode styling
├── js/
│   ├── app.js              # Main application logic
│   ├── gps-tracker.js      # GPS/speed tracking engine
│   ├── map.js              # Map initialization & updates
│   ├── stats.js            # Statistics calculation
│   ├── storage.js          # IndexedDB wrapper
│   └── utils.js            # Utility functions
├── assets/
│   ├── kitzbuehel-trails.geojson  # Ski trail data
│   └── icons/              # App icons for iOS
└── README.md               # Installation instructions
```

