### JavaScript Modules

#### [NEW] [js/app.js](file:///Users/sebastianfackelmann/Documents/Projects/SKI_APP/js/app.js)
Application orchestrator:
- Initialize GPS tracking
- Manage app state (idle/tracking/paused)
- Coordinate UI updates
- Handle run start/stop/save

#### [NEW] [js/gps-tracker.js](file:///Users/sebastianfackelmann/Documents/Projects/SKI_APP/js/gps-tracker.js)
GPS tracking engine using `navigator.geolocation.watchPosition()`:
- Real-time speed from GPS (converted to km/h)
- Heading/direction calculation
- Altitude tracking
- Distance calculation using Haversine formula
- Accuracy filtering to reject bad GPS readings

#### [NEW] [js/map.js](file:///Users/sebastianfackelmann/Documents/Projects/SKI_APP/js/map.js)
Interactive map with:
- Mapbox GL initialization centered on Kitzbühel
- Ski trail overlay from GeoJSON
- Live user position marker
- Trail highlighting based on position
- Zoom controls optimized for gloves

#### [NEW] [js/stats.js](file:///Users/sebastianfackelmann/Documents/Projects/SKI_APP/js/stats.js)
Statistics engine:
- Max speed tracking
- Total distance accumulation
- Vertical meters calculation
- Run duration timing
- Pace and average speed

#### [NEW] [js/storage.js](file:///Users/sebastianfackelmann/Documents/Projects/SKI_APP/js/storage.js)
Data persistence:
- IndexedDB wrapper for run history
- Personal records storage
- Export/import functionality
- Data migration support

